1Sa 31:1 , Saul, having lost his army, and his sons slain, he and his armour-bearer kill themselves;
1Sa 31:7 , The Philistines possess the forsaken towns of the Israelites;
1Sa 31:8 , They triumph over the dead carcases;
1Sa 31:11 , They of Jabesh-gilead recovering the dead bodies by night, burn them at Jabesh, and mournfully bury their bones.
